,{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-01-12T10:33:10Z","updated_at":"2026-01-12T11:10:08Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Godot v4.6.beta\n- Godot v4.5.1\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated Intel(R) Iris(R) Xe Graphics (Intel Corporation; 32.0.101.7076) - 11th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-1135G7 @ 2.40GHz (8 threads) - 15.80 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nThere is a scene before baking (the preview environment is enabled):\n<img width=\"2160\" height=\"1368\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f924a61c-eb0f-4997-82a5-21afd9e47016\" />\n\nThe scene after baking:\n<img width=\"2160\" height=\"1368\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/41403df3-0ebd-4289-ae52-4073ebea4f8a\" />\n\nThe preview environment is disabled and the lightmap is visible:\n<img width=\"2160\" height=\"1368\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eeb5f9be-9140-488f-8fca-4f147fbf8b0d\" />\n\nRebaking with the preview environment disabled produces a different result:\n<img width=\"2160\" height=\"1368\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5a6fe661-1a46-4127-b84e-c7687c5ce55b\" />\n\nDocumentation says that the preview environment is ignored and that only the WorldEnvironment node is taken into account.\n<img width=\"749\" height=\"393\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0fbd95ae-79e7-4f00-adfe-bbdb77d0b004\" />\nHowever, under the hood, the preview environment creates a node but does not set an owner, so it is not visible in the scene tree\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Bake a LightmapGI with review environment enabled\n- Then bake it with preview environment disabled\n- Notice the difference\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[lightmap-editor-environment.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24561613/lightmap-editor-environment.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114878/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114878/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}